@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### Rooms – RoomResponse DTO
# @name rooms
GET {{base}}/rooms?minCapacity=4

### Create booking – CreateBookingRequest DTO -> NewBooking
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": "{{rooms.response.body.$[0].id}}",
  "userId": "0199a3f0-0000-7000-8000-000000000007",
  "startTime": "2026-10-05T09:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-10-05T10:30:00Z",
  "attendees": 3
}

### Bookings – BookingResponse with derived durationMinutes
GET {{base}}/bookings?status=ACTIVE
